// Adrenaline Rush: authored haste burst for the hardcoded EF_HASTEUP.
// A gold body flash, a ground shockwave, fast rising speed streaks and a few
// star glints; a cast burst, not a persistent aura. Only soft-edged billboard
// textures: the ring_*/lens_* bands are cylinder wraps and read as boxes here.
// The separate native adrenaline.str belongs to Advanced Adrenaline Rush.
// Coordinates follow inc_agi.strfx.ron: (319, 291) is the caster's feet, smaller
// y is higher, 1024 angle units per turn.
(
    fps: 30,
    layers: [
        // Ground shockwave: a flattened glow spreading out from the feet.
        (
            textures: ["ro://data/texture/effect/glow11.bmp"],
            blend: Add,
            keys: [
                (at: 0, offset: (319.0, 291.0), quad: (40.0, 12.0), color: (255, 200, 80, 0)),
                (at: 3, offset: (319.0, 291.0), quad: (140.0, 40.0), color: (255, 205, 90, 255)),
